---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="col stance">
      <span class="eyebrow">field manual</span>
      <p>ERCs are interfaces. LSPs are the system. A field manual for Ethereum ERC problems and the LUKSO standards that were designed instead of layered.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="col links">
      <span class="eyebrow">resources</span>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/problems/">Problems</a></li>
        <li><a href="/standards/">Standards</a></li>
        <li><a href="/standards/matrix/">Ethereum ERC ↔ LSP matrix</a></li>
        <li><a href="/build/">Build verticals</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="col links">
      <span class="eyebrow">handoff</span>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://docs.lukso.tech/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">docs.lukso.tech ↗</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/lukso-network" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">github / lukso-network ↗</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="meta">
    <span>© {year} ERCs, Solved.</span>
    <span class="sep">·</span>
    <span>independent reference, unaffiliated with the LUKSO foundation</span>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    margin-top: var(--s-10);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--ink-line);
    background: var(--ink-black);
  }
  .inner {
    max-width: var(--container);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--s-8) var(--s-5) var(--s-6);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.4fr) repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--s-7);
  }
  .col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--s-3); }
  .stance p { color: var(--ink-bone-dim); max-width: 38ch; }
  .col ul { display: grid; gap: var(--s-2); }
  .col a {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--t-mono-sm);
    color: var(--ink-bone-dim);
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
  }
  .col a:hover { color: var(--signal-pink); border-bottom-color: var(--signal-pink); }

  .meta {
    max-width: var(--container);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--s-4) var(--s-5) var(--s-6);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--ink-line);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--t-mono-xs);
    color: var(--ink-fog);
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--s-3);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .sep { color: var(--ink-line); }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--s-5); padding: var(--s-7) var(--s-4) var(--s-5); }
    .meta { padding: var(--s-4); }
  }
</style>
